// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Arbiter Rein 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P337451205" "Arbiter Rein"
// ProfessionString :
"P1376822437" "Arachnos Arbiter"
// DescriptionString :
"P1455892612" "Arbiter Rein is responsible for instructing Destined Ones new to Grandville about the Arachnos Patrons: Black Scorpion, Captain Mako, Ghost Widow, and Scirocco."
// HelloString :
"P2838520987" "Greetings, Destined One!"
// HelloString :
"P3769876236" "Arachnos welcomes you, {VillainName}!"
// HelloString :
"P1108041932" "You have been expected, {VillainName}!"
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P1432550232" "You should never see this."
// FirstVisitString :
"P3678014751" "I am Arbiter Rein. I oversee the arrival of Destined Ones to Grandville, and recruit them to serve in one of the four major Arachnos factions headed by Black Scorpion, Captain Mako, Ghost Widow, and Scirocco. If you are interested in joining one of these factions, I can tell you what each of the factions can offer you in terms of power. I will warn you now, once your choice of faction is made, it will be an arduous endeavor to undo it!"
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P312100120" "I have told you everything you need to know. Choose your patron wisely!"
// PlayerBusyString :
"P2734710083" "I require your undivided attention, {VillainName}. Take care of your other tasks before returning to me."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P158550323" "Return when you have reached Threat Level {Level}, Destined One."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P3412332654" "You should now know what each of the factions have to offer you, but if you are still uncertain you should go back to the patron plaques and read what they have to say.  Remember: once you choose your patron, your allegiance within Arachnos will be very difficult to alter!"
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P856364347" ""
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P449618495" "Our business is concluded, {VillainName}."
// LocationString :
"P3340683840" "Grandville"
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
"P421137857" "You must now choose which faction of Arachnos you wish to join."
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


