// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Black Scorpion 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P1258505021" "Black Scorpion"
// ProfessionString :
"P3281220330" "Arachnos Patron"
// DescriptionString :
"P4259965787" "Ernesto Rodriguez embodies the concept of raw power through technology. Whatever it takes, whatever piece of his body or soul needs to be spliced, altered, or removed to grant him more power, Ernesto seems willing to do it. His unbridled hunger, absolute loyalty, and low intelligence makes him the perfect servant for Lord Recluse."
// HelloString :
"P2840620893" "Let's get to work."
// HelloString :
"P3924089156" "Fear me!"
// HelloString :
"P1513541354" "Trust no one."
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P928080755" "Who are you? You'd best get lost before I blast ya!"
// FirstVisitString :
"P3507779401" "You know who I am. I'm the greatest and most powerful of Lord Recluse's lieutenants - Black Scorpion! I alone have the raw power necessary to enforce his will. If you prove yourself strong enough, you will have the chance to enforce my will!"
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P344753984" "I know it's only a matter of time before you turn on me again. Since the Arbiters and Lord Recluse are watching you closely, I'm just going to let you walk instead of blasting you away. Now get lost before I change my mind!"
// PlayerBusyString :
"P2524251088" "You've got too much happening, {VillainName}! Clear your plate 'cause Black Scorpion has a job for you!"
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P2705887230" "You're not ready for what I got for you, {VillainName}. Come back when you've achieved Threat Level {Level}."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P3660146979" "You're ambitious, aren't you, {VillainName}. I can respect ambition."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P375005273" "You're packing some serious power, {VillainName}. I respect power more than ambition."
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P3193136057" "I believe we're finished, {VillainName}."
// LocationString :
// IntroString :
"P1286183" "Black Scorpion, as you may already know, possesses a unique suit of power armor which secures his position within the Arachnos hierarchy. He commands the mechanical Tarantulas of Arachnos, no doubt in order to oversee the robotics technologies our technicians make upon these heavy combat units. Black Scorpion is assisted in part by Silver Mantis, a woman who shares his obsession with armored augmentation."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P2033588590" "Choose Black Scorpion as Patron"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P3468659051" "Black Scorpion respects raw power, as long as you don't overreach yourself."
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P577188592" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>Black Scorpion</a> is one of Lord Recluse's enforcers, and a deadly combatant."
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
"P2818147590" "I know some <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>people</a> who would like to meet you."
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


