// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Captain Mako 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P2085354169" "Captain Mako"
// ProfessionString :
// DescriptionString :
"P1158560865" "Gideon Ray is a savage mutant who has evolved into what can only be described as a humanoid shark. His acts are even more terrible than his appearance, and few foes are even identifiable once Mako is through with them. Mako is responsible for the death of Sharkhead Isle's most famous hero, Scrapyard."
// HelloString :
"P1255738098" "You come to play with Mako, {VillainName}?"
// HelloString :
"P1171278183" "Sink or swim, {VillainName}."
// HelloString :
"P4058620574" "There's blood in the water! I can smell it."
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P4264449665" "Get lost, little guppy, before you're lunch!"
// FirstVisitString :
"P2026263216" "You know who I am. The great Captain Mako, hero of the Rogue Isles! I'm the one Recluse goes to when he's got a problem. Pray that you don't become a problem.<br><br>I got some work that needs getting done, and if you help me out, I'll make sure you're well rewarded. Got it? Good."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P296068086" "Got nothin' for ya, chum. Go swim somewhere else."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P364701680" "You gotta take care of some of your other work first."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P3201290604" "You got nothin', guppy! Come talk to me when you're at least Threat Level {Level}."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P3184529708" "You've got a killer instinct, {VillainName}."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P4078727612" "You're stone cold, {VillainName}!"
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P1463010204" "Time for me to find some new prey. See ya around, {VillainName}."
// LocationString :
// IntroString :
"P1017437481" "Captain Mako himself would like to meet you - be prepared. His reputation as a savage is not undeserved, for this mutant has performed many an unsavory task on behalf of Arachnos. He is a cunning and relentless killer, and those who serve him should show no sign of weakness. He commands the Crab Spiders of Arachnos and can be found in the company of Barracuda, a minion nearly as callous as her master."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P1074922486" "Choose Captain Mako as your Patron"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P2673655206" "Captain Mako respects other predators, everyone else is prey."
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P2137867822" "You've heard of <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>Captain Mako</a>? He's one of Lord Recluse's lieutenants, and a nasty fighter."
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


