// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Ghost Widow 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P1200458581" "Ghost Widow"
// ProfessionString :
"P3315240932" "Arachnos Matron"
// DescriptionString :
"P345473789" "Beautiful, mysterious, and deadly. Ghost Widow appears to be an actual spirit from beyond the grave rather than a super with some sort of incorporeal power. Some have said she was once a rising star in the Night Widows when she was slain. Her thirst for vengeance must have been great, for she returned from the void and now serves at Recluse's side. There are rumors that her service isn't entirely voluntary, however."
// HelloString :
"P1682332575" "Come closer, {VillainName}."
// HelloString :
"P2772534602" "Are you afraid? Good."
// HelloString :
"P653182520" "What do you wish to speak about, {VillainName}?"
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P3659690772" "Don't you know that you should not disturb the dead? Leave."
// FirstVisitString :
"P3398883757" "So, one of the Destined of Arachnos comes to me, and with high praise from the Arbiters. You've left a trail of wreckage and bodies in your wake, shattered dreams and broken lives, and this is only the beginning. Now, let us see what nightmares we can unleash together."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P292605992" "You have traveled time and done the impossible. I think that we've done enough together."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P3268438786" "Do not mock the tasks I have by splitting your attention so. Complete your other, lesser tasks, then return to me."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P3743210116" "Return when you present at least a threat level of {Level}. Lord Recluse thinks that you will be ready then."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P191603966" "It is difficult for the dead to learn to trust, but you have done much for me. I think I will trust you. Contact me at any time."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P231249951" "I now stand on the cusp of mortality, and I have you to thank. I will not forget this moment, I assure you."
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P3926320444" "You will likely never see this."
// LocationString :
// IntroString :
"P3282380350" "The deadly - and undead - wraith called the Ghost Widow is one of the most trusted members of Lord Recluse's inner circle. She was once a night widow assassin, but after her death she became something much more. Now, as a ghost she has been bound to Arachnos, and haunts the Rogue Isles hunting down the foes of Lord Recluse. She commands the Widows and Fortunatas of Arachnos, and is often protected by her bodyguard, the mutated creature called the Wretch."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P872747105" "Choose Ghost Widow as your Patron"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P2266778908" "I think you will find Ghost Widow an... Interesting choice of Patron. I will inform her immediately"
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


